WEBVTT

00:07:28.966 --> 00:07:34.284
so we're going to see many waves
and new applications coming up over time.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:37.543
CA: In his hilarious sci-fi book,

00:07:37.567 --> 00:07:40.821
Douglas Adams, who wrote
"The Hitchhiker’s Guide to the Galaxy,"

00:07:40.845 --> 00:07:44.445
he had in that book a Babel fish
that you put in your ear

00:07:44.469 --> 00:07:48.393
and it automatically translated
any language coming in.

00:07:49.064 --> 00:07:50.929
There are already devices on the market

00:07:50.953 --> 00:07:56.338
that are staring to do this
in still, I guess, fairly primitive form,

00:07:56.362 --> 00:07:57.903
but how long do you think it is

00:07:57.927 --> 00:08:02.791
before any tourist can go
to any major city on the planet